<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Thou art Thyself the very God,</l><l>Thou dost embody Him;</l><l>In Thee is manifested God,</l><l>And we see God therein.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Effulgence of God’s glory, Thou,</l><l>By Thee God shines on us;</l><l>Expression of His substance, Thou,</l><l>In Thee He’s real to us.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>In Thee God is the life to us,</l><l>In Thee He is the light;</l><l>In Thee His nature we partake</l><l>And with Him we unite.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>In Thee the grace of God subsists,</l><l>God we enjoy in Thee;</l><l>His truth in Thee is also found,</l><l>His full reality.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>In Thee God’s fulness we receive,</l><l>Which fills from grace to grace;</l><l>In Thee with God we’re mingled here,</l><l>Till one in every phase.</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>O Lord our God, we worship Thee,</l><l>In Thee we have our all;</l><l>Thyself we treasure in our heart,</l><l>Thy Name we love to call.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
